msgid "Pre check"
msgstr ""

msgid "Everything looks fine; you should be able to perform the update without any problems."
msgstr ""

msgid "The <code>App::url()->type</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.39</strong> (released on August 13, 2026), but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::url()->type</code> with <code>App::url()->getType()</code>)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Some distributed themes may appear in this list if you copied them to a directory other than Dotclear's <var>themes</var> directory.<br>In that case, we recommend deleting them from your custom directory and using the button labeled “ Add the distributed themes here ” on the blog's appearance page."
msgstr ""

msgid "The <code>form::???()</code> methods are (strongly) deprecated as of <strong>Dotclear 2.26</strong> (released on May 13, 2023), but are still used in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by using <code>Helper/Html/Form/...</code>)."
msgstr ""

msgid "The usage of these behaviors should be removed or replaced as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong> (see CHANGELOG or code)."
msgstr ""

msgid "The <code>App::backend()->popup</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>, but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::backend()->popup === 1</code> with <code>App::backend()->isPopup()</code>).<br><br>Also the <code>App::backend()->plugin_id</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>, but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::backend()->plugin_id === 'admin.blog.theme'</code> with <code>MediaItem::isPopup()</code>)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Note that these modifications do not cause any issues with Dotclear 2.40 <strong>if and only if</strong> the <var>DC_MODERN</var> constant is set to <samp>false</samp> (or does not appear at all) in the configuration file (<var>inc/config.php</var>)."
msgstr ""

msgid "The 2nd and 3rd argument of <code>WidgetsElement::checkHomeOnly()</code> are no longer taken into account as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>."
msgstr ""

msgid "The 6th argument of <code>WidgetsElement::setting()</code> are no longer taken into account as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>."
msgstr ""

msgid "<code>dcCore</code> and <code>dcUtils</code> are deprecated since <strong>Dotclear 2.28</strong> (published on November 15, 2023) and are still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them."
msgstr ""

msgid "<code>form</code> and <code>formSelectOption</code> classes are deprecated since <strong>Dotclear 2.26</strong> (published on May 13, 2023) and are still present in the following modules.<br>You must review and update them by using their replacements (see <code>Dotclear/Helper/Html/Form/...</code>)."
msgstr ""

msgid "The JQuery methods <code>expandContent</code>, <code>toggleWithLegend</code> and <code>toggleWithDetails</code> class are deprecated and are still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them by using the Javascript <code>dotclear</code> object equivalent methods (see admin/js/common.js)."
msgstr ""

msgid "<code>Clearbricks</code> class is deprecated since <strong>Dotclear 2.26</strong> (published on May 13, 2023) and are still present in the following modules.<br>You must review and update them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Global variables <code>$_ctx</code>, <code>__l10n</code>, <code>__l10n_files</code>, <code>_lang</code>, <code>_menu</code>, <code>mod_files</code>, <code>mod_ts</code>, <code>_page_number</code>, <code>p_url</code> and <code>__widgets</code> are deprecated since <strong>Dotclear 2.23</strong> (published on August 13, 2022) and are still present in the following modules.<br>You must review and update them."
msgstr ""
